Thu Aug 13 17:32:41 UTC 2026 - Victor Carvalho <victor.carvalho@suse.com>

- Declare the parallel-minor exclusion: every subpackage now provides
  and conflicts its unversioned containerized-data-importer-<subpackage>
  name (containerized-data-importer1.65 already provides these), so
  co-named binaries are a declared package conflict instead of an
  undeclared file conflict. Fixes the request 1370732 decline
  ("conflicts with 1.65": /usr/bin/virt-cdi-* and /usr/bin/cdi-cloner
  shipped by both minors with no conflict relationship).

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu Aug 13 14:05:10 UTC 2026 - Victor Carvalho <victor.carvalho@suse.com>

- Enable aarch64 on the SLE 16 code stream: widen the 16.x
  _exclusive_arch define from x86_64 to x86_64 aarch64, matching the
  SLE 15 and Tumbleweed branches. The x86_64-only define was inherited
  from the original packaging; the aarch64 build is required for arm64
  container images on SLE 16.

