Wed Aug 05 21:31:07 UTC 2026 - Victor Toso de Carvalho <victor.carvalho@suse.com>

- Initial package containerized-data-importer1.66: CDI v1.66.0, the
  versioned fork of the containerized-data-importer1.65 packaging so
  multiple minor releases are maintained in parallel. Each minor starts
  its own changelog; the pre-fork history lives in
  containerized-data-importer1.65.
  Release notes:
  https://github.com/kubevirt/containerized-data-importer/releases/tag/v1.66.0
- Carry 0001-tests-lift-client-qps-burst.patch (test-only, applies to
  the -tests subpackage e2e suite; not yet upstream).
- Same binary set as 1.65; manifests and the compiled e2e suite install
  under the versioned data directory cdi-1.66.
- Bake the opensuse/ registry path with the plain version tag into the
  release manifests (bsc#1272604): the kubevirt/ path stopped receiving
  pushes with the unversioned-package retirement, and the
  release-suffixed tags are never published.
